<title>USA: TABLE - Crestar Financial Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Crestar Financial Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.68		    $0.60</p>
<p> Net			 75,800		   66,900</p>
<p> Net int. income	221,200			N/a</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	  36,000		   24,400</p>
<p> Retun on equity	  16.48			N/a</p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.32		    $1.18</p>
<p> Net			147,600		  132,000</p>
<p> Net int. income	443,400			N/a</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	     N/a			N/a</p>
<p> Retun on equity	  16.27			N/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>		(Return on equity is in percent)</p>
<p>NOTE: Current quarter includes gain $17.3 million on sale of merchant card processing business.</p>
<p>Q2 net interest income roughly flat versus year-ago.</p>
<p>Q2 included non-interest expense of $4.3 million for year 2000 compliance costs.</p>
<p>Six-month net interest income up two percent versus year-ago.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
